<country>JP</country> </address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KUROKI HITOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ROBERGE GUY</name><address><country>CA</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ASANO, NAOKI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FU, GUO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUJITSU LIMITED</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KUROKI, HITOSHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ROBERGE, GUY</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ASANO NAOKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FU GUO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KUROKI HITOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ROBERGE GUY</name><address><country>CA</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ASANO, NAOKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FU, GUO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KUROKI, HITOSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ROBERGE, GUY</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>It is intended to enable quick determination of an accurate parting line. Plane projection means (2) projects an edge of a product shape expressed by three-dimensional graphic data (1) onto a plane perpendicular to the opening direction of the mold, thus producing plane projection data (3). Parting line determination means (4) sequentially determines, as a parting line, a candidate edge having the largest interior angle at a contact with a deterministic parting line on the plane projection data, from among candidate edges adjacent to the deterministic parting line already determined as a parting line. Thus, a parting line (1a) of a mold for shaping the product shape expressed by the three-dimensional graphic data (1) is determined.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention est destinée à permettre une détermination rapide d'une ligne de joint précise. Un dispositif de projection sur plan (2) projette le bord d'une forme de produit exprimée par des données graphiques tridimensionnelles (1) sur un plan perpendiculaire à la direction d'ouverture du moule, ce qui permet de créer des données de projection sur plan (3). Un dispositif de détermination de ligne de joint (4) détermine de manière séquentielle une ligne de joint qui se présente sous la forme d'un bord candidat dont l'angle intérieur le plus grand est en contact avec une ligne de joint déterministe sur les données de projection sur plan. Cette ligne de joint est déterminée parmi des bords candidats adjacents à la ligne de joint déterministe ayant déjà été déterminée comme ligne de joint. Il est ainsi possible de déterminer une ligne de joint (1a) d'un moule servant à façonner la forme de produit exprimée par des données graphiques tridimensionnelles (1).</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>